Description: Ceratopsian theme for the Trinity Desktop Environment
 TDE counterpart of Debian's desktop-base: TDE wallpaper, KSplash theme and
 TDM login theme based on the Debian 13 (trixie) Ceratopsian artwork, so TDE
 matches the Plymouth boot splash and the rest of the Debian desktop.
 .
 Unlike desktop-base-trinity (a Debian 5/6-era fork), this package builds on
 the real desktop-base instead of conflicting with and replacing it. It also
 ships the TDE default profile (wallpaper, splash theme) and the kompmgr/
 compton-tde compositor settings.

